{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20090","headline":"送无怀道士游富春山水 · 孟郊","name":"送无怀道士游富春山水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"造化绝高处，富春独多观。\n山浓翠滴洒，水折珠摧残。\n溪镜不隐发，树衣长遇寒。\n风猿虚空飞，月狖叫啸酸。\n信此神僊路，岂爲时俗安。\n煮金阴阳火，囚怪星宿坛。\n花发我未识，玉生忽藂攒。\n蓬莱浮荡漾，非道相从难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}